@startuml
|Pharmacist|
start
:Select a submitted prescription;
|Pharmacy system|
:Retrieve the prescription linked
to its customer and order;
|Pharmacist|
:Review the uploaded prescription;
|Pharmacy system|
:Validate prescription and read current status;
if (Review outcome?) then ([valid])
  |Pharmacist|
  :Approve prescription;
  |Pharmacy system|
  :Save Approved status;
  :Recheck order eligibility;
elseif () then ([invalid])
  |Pharmacist|
  :Reject and record reason;
  |Pharmacy system|
  :Save Rejected status;
else ([unclear or incomplete])
  |Pharmacist|
  :Enter clarification question;
  |Pharmacy system|
  :Save Clarification Requested status;
endif
|Notification service|
:Notify customer of the saved status;
note right
  Approved: send approval status.
  Rejected: include rejection reason.
  Clarification: include the question.
end note
|Pharmacy system|
:Return review result to pharmacist;
stop
@enduml
